    Part "Checkpoint" Size=8.443,0.937,8.543 Anchored BottomSurface=Smooth CFrame=480.735,-107.063,308.581|-180,0,180 Color=#D40004 EnableFluidForces=false Material=Neon TopSurface=Smooth {
